        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-3">🔧</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Havells Specialists</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Our technicians are specifically trained to handle all Havells models, including Max and Pro series.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-3">🛡️</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Genuine Parts</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">We never use local duplicates. Only 100% original Havells spare parts with a 90-day warranty.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-3">⏱️</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Fast Service</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">We know clean water is important. That's why we reach your doorstep within 60 minutes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

