          <div class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-sm">- Suresh P. (Whitefield)</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 8. FAQs -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white px-4 border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 text-center mb-8">Havells Water Purifier FAQs</h2>
      
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <details class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group shadow-sm" open>
          <summary class="font-bold text-gray-900 flex justify-between items-center list-none">
            How much does Havells RO service cost in Bangalore?
            <span class="text-blue-900 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm">The basic visit and diagnosis charge is ₹299. This amount is completely waived off if you get your Havells RO repaired by us. Spare parts are charged separately based on the issue.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group shadow-sm">
          <summary class="font-bold text-gray-900 flex justify-between items-center list-none">
            Do you use genuine Havells spare parts?
            <span class="text-blue-900 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm">Yes, we only use 100% original Havells filters, membranes, and pumps. All replaced parts come with a 90-day warranty.</p>
        </details>
        
        <details class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group shadow-sm">
          <summary class="font-bold text-gray-900 flex justify-between items-center list-none">
            My Havells RO is out of warranty. Can you still repair it?
            <span class="text-blue-900 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm">Absolutely! We are an independent service center. We provide out-of-warranty repairs for all Havells models at very affordable rates.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group shadow-sm">
          <summary class="font-bold text-gray-900 flex justify-between items-center list-none">
            How long does it take to repair a Havells RO?
            <span class="text-blue-900 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm">Most common issues (like leaks, pump failure, or filter changes) are fixed on the spot within 30-45 minutes.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 9. SERVICE AREAS -->
  <section class="py-12 bg-blue-50 px-4 text-center border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Havells RO Repair in Your Area</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2">
        <span class="bg-white text-gray-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium border border-gray-200">Whitefield</span>
        <span class="bg-white text-gray-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium border border-gray-200">Koramangala</span>
